    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061123.0036\n\nWARSAW, Nov. 23 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nAll trapped miners killed in Poland's mine explosion\n\n\n\n\nAll 23 miners trapped in a mine explosion in southern Poland were confirmed dead, the official PAP news agency reported on Thursday.\n\nThe confirmation came after the last body of the trapped miners was recovered by rescue teams, the report said.",
